{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05643","headline":"送魏骑曹充宇文侍御判官分按山南 · 孙逖","name":"送魏骑曹充宇文侍御判官分按山南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云雨阳台路，光华驿骑巡。\n劝农开梦土，恤隐惠荆人。\n楼迥吟黄鹤，江长望白苹。\n观风布明诏，更是汉南春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05643.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05643","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}